{"last_link_id": 451, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## SeedVR2\n\nOne-step video restoration / upscale (ICLR 2026). This workflow uses the **3B Int8** model for video upscaling.\n\n- Project: [SeedVR2](https://iceclear.github.io/projects/seedvr2/)\n- ComfyUI native support: [PR #14424](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/14424)\n\n### Subgraph parameters\n\n- **trim_video**: enable to cut a segment before upscaling\n- **trim_start_time / duration**: trim start (seconds) and length\n- **scale_multiplier**: upscale factor (default `2`)\n- **seed / sampler / scheduler / denoise**: sampling controls; `denoise=1` means full restore\n- **color_correction_method**: optional color match to original (default `none`)\n- **unet_name / vae_name**: model files to load\n\n### Tip: long videos\n\nIf the input is too long, turn on **trim_video**, upscale in shorter segments, then merge them. This helps avoid OOM / slowdowns on long clips.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: SeedVR2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [500, 730], "pos": [-3779.64111328125, -2025.7972412109375], "id": 144, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["Guide: [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n## Model Links\n\n**vae**\n\n- [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│       └── seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [500, 730], "pos": [-4329.64111328125, -2025.7972412109375], "id": 143, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [361], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["latent"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "GetNode", "title": "Get_latent", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [210, 58], "pos": [-639.7402954101562, 1010.5078125], "id": 184, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes", "Node name for S&R": "GetNode"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [343], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [270, 262], "pos": [-402.0554504394531, 774.5078125], "widgets_values": [20260725, "fixed", 1, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 451, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 106, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 107, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "ne